  "solution": "<div class=\"tex-center\"><figure class=\"tex-figure\"><img src=\"/bank-assets/063e65180d0f0d185e8f62348dfc7e8c75994b0c0272f703fdfa3de092dd9cc0.svg\" alt=\"Hình minh họa\" loading=\"lazy\"><span class=\"figure-zoom\" aria-hidden=\"true\">⤢</span></figure></div>\n\t\tChân tháp hình chóp cụt tứ giác đều <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>.</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>O</mi></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là tâm của hai đáy, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình vuông <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình vuông <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>′</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>′</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac displaystyle=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>A</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>\n\t\tKẻ <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>⊥</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> với <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math>. <br> \n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>′</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là hình chữ nhật <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">{</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>O</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>H</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math> <br>\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>. <br>\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>△</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>H</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mi>H</mi></semantics></math> <br>\n\t\t<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>′</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mi>C</mi><msup><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mrow><msup><mn>4</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo>⇒</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>′</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mi>′</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>14</mn></msqrt></mrow></semantics></math>. <br> \n\t\tDiện tích đáy lớn là <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>6</mn><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>36</mn></mrow></semantics></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"inline\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow></semantics></math>. <br> \n\t\tDiện tích đáy bé là <math xmlns=\"http:/